94 4.39886L1.85094 0.898862C1.519 0.566916 0.980807 0.566916 0.648862 0.898862Z"></path></svg></div></li><li aria-current="page" class="text-body-secondary-color">Pre/Post-market data</li></ol></nav></div></div><div class=""><div class="article intercom-force-break"><div class="mb-10 max-lg:mb-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col"><h1 class="mb-1 font-primary text-2xl font-bold leading-10 text-body-primary-color">Pre/Post-market data</h1><div class="text-md font-normal leading-normal text-body-secondary-color"><p>Use extended-hours market data to cover pre-market and after-hours sessions</p></div></div><div class="avatar"><div class="avatar__photo"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-lg font-bold leading-6 text-primary-text shadow-solid-2 shadow-body-bg [&amp;:nth-child(n+2)]:hidden lg:[&amp;:nth-child(n+2)]:inline-flex h-8 w-8 sm:h-9 sm:w-9 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://static.intercomassets.com/avatars/5048555/square_128/image_2021-05-07_19-10-26-1624014864.png&quot;)"></span></div><div class="avatar__info -mt-0.5 text-base"><span class="text-body-secondary-color"><div>Written by <span>Team</span></div> <time dateTime="2026-01-12T11:36:52Z" title="Updated over 9 months ago">January 12, 2026</time></span></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="jsx-7b3ac4f8d5337043 article_body"><article class="jsx-7b3ac4f8d5337043 "><div class="intercom-interblocks-subheading intercom-interblocks-align-left"><h2 id="h_b5abaa29f2">What “extended hours” includes</h2></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-subheading3 intercom-interblocks-align-left"><h3 id="h_60e2dc5b74">U.S. real-time extended hours</h3></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-unordered-nested-list"><ul><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Hours:</b> 7:00 AM–8:00 PM ET  </p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Availability:</b> Pro plan or higher</p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Markets:</b> U.S. &amp; Cboe Europe only (no extended-hours support for other markets)</p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Supported intervals:</b></p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-unordered-nested-list"><ul><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p>1-minute</p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p>5-minute</p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p>15-minute</p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p>30-minute</p></div></li></ul></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Streaming</b>: WebSocket supports extended hours for U.S. markets only</p></div></li></ul></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p> </p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-subheading3 intercom-interblocks-align-left"><h3 id="h_93bc65c779">U.S. historical extended hours</h3></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-unordered-nested-list"><ul><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Hours covered:</b> 4:00 AM–8:00 PM ET  </p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Availability:</b> for records older than one day</p></div></li></ul></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p> </p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p> </p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-subheading intercom-interblocks-align-left"><h2 id="h_9f204c4c9b">How to include pre/post-market data</h2></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p>Add <code>prepost=true</code> to these endpoints:</p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-unordered-nested-list"><ul><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><code>/time_series</code></p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><code>/quote</code></p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><code>/price</code></p></div></li><li><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><code>/eod</code></p></div></li></ul></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p> </p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Example request</b></p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-code"><pre>https://api.twelvedata.com/quote?symbol=AAPL&amp;exchange=NASDAQ&amp;prepost=true &amp;apikey=YOUR_API_KEY</pre></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p> </p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><b>Example response</b></p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-code"><pre>{<br/>  &quot;symbol&quot;: &quot;AAPL&quot;,<br/>  &quot;exchange&quot;: &quot;NASDAQ&quot;,<br/>  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Apple Inc&quot;,<br/>  &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,<br/>  &quot;datetime&quot;: &quot;2026-01-12 07:58:00&quot;,<br/>  &quot;timestamp&quot;: 1768204680,<br/>  &quot;open&quot;: &quot;187.20&quot;,<br/>  &quot;high&quot;: &quot;187.45&quot;,<br/>  &quot;low&quot;: &quot;187.10&quot;,<br/>  &quot;close&quot;: &quot;187.38&quot;,<br/>  &quot;volume&quot;: &quot;412385&quot;,<br/>  &quot;previous_close&quot;: &quot;186.95&quot;,<br/>  &quot;change&quot;: &quot;0.43&quot;,<br/>  &quot;percent_change&quot;: &quot;0.23&quot;,<br/>  &quot;is_extended_hours&quot;: true<br/>}</pre></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p> </p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p> </p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-subheading intercom-interblocks-align-left"><h2 id="h_d7db7e6036">Read more</h2></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><a href="https://support.twelvedata.com/en/articles/9935903-us-equities-market-data">US equities market data</a></p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><a href="https://support.twelvedata.com/en/articles/5745849-timezones">Timezones</a></p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p><a href="https://support.twelvedata.com/en/articles/6487105-how-do-i-upgrade-my-subscription">Upgrading your subscription </a></p></div><div class="intercom-interblocks-paragraph no-margin intercom-interblocks-align-left"><p> </p></div></article></div></div></div></div><fieldset class="intercom-reaction-picker m-0 -mb-4 -ml-4 -mr-4 mt-6 rounded-card border-0 sm:-mb-2 sm:-ml-1 sm:-mr-1 sm:mt-8"><legend id=":R1mbq6:" class="intercom-reaction-prompt float-start w-full">Did this answer your question?</legend><div class="intercom-reactions-container"><button class="intercom-reaction" aria-labelledby=":R1mbq6: :Rrmbq6:" tabindex="0" data-reaction-text="disappointed" aria-pressed="false"><span id=":Rrmbq6:" class="sr-only">Disappointed Reaction</span><span aria-hidden="true" title="Disappointed">😞</span></button><button class="intercom-reaction" aria-labelledby=":R1mbq6: :R1bmbq6:" tabindex="0" data-reaction-text="neutral" aria-pressed="false"><span id=":R1bmbq6:" 